      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Even though I hadn't so much as properly asked,\r\nyou still lent your aid — truly, I am deeply\r\nbeholden. Henceforth, should any difficulty\r\narise, I shall be sure to make a\r\nformal request of you.",
